{
  "$schema": "https://schemas.cerberauth.com/identity-provider/draft/2024-09/provider.schema.json",
  "name": "WSO2 Identity Server",
  "abstract": "Open-source identity and access management server from WSO2, also offered as the SaaS WSO2 Identity Platform (formerly Asgardeo). Covers passwordless, social and enterprise login, adaptive and multi-factor authentication, OIDC, SAML 2.0 and WS-Federation, SCIM 2.0 provisioning, B2B organizations with delegated administration, role-based access control, scripted conditional authentication, webhooks and pre-flow actions. Recent releases add identity for AI agents and MCP servers. Run it self-hosted on Kubernetes or VMs with MySQL, PostgreSQL, SQL Server, Oracle or DB2 under Apache-2.0 with commercial support, or use the multi-tenant SaaS with a Free plan up to 15,000 monthly active users.",
